### Empryo ###
# Repo-local .empryo/ (project agents, genome, sessions) stays ignored.
# Anchored so it does not also hide dots/.empryo.
/.empryo
# Global config tracked under dots/.empryo; runtime state stays in ~/.empryo.
dots/.empryo/*
!dots/.empryo/config.json
!dots/.empryo/EMPRYO.md
!dots/.empryo/tui-layout.json
!dots/.empryo/orchestrations/
!dots/.empryo/.empryo/
dots/.empryo/.empryo/*
!dots/.empryo/.empryo/memory-config.json

### no-mistakes (config only; runtime state stays in ~/.no-mistakes) ###
dots/.no-mistakes/*
!dots/.no-mistakes/config.yaml
